3f:["$","p",null,{"children":["What it actually means is ",["$","em",null,{"children":"this worker process is running inside this image"}],",\nwhich the worker asserts, and the scheduler matches on. The value has to be\nbyte-for-byte what your build requests, or actions queue forever in the usual\nsilent way. ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/remote-execution/containers-and-images","children":"Containers and images"}],"\ncovers using it correctly."]}]
